obs Writing a moonshot essay under a rushed reading risks the exact fault Gauge names -- a claim without its falsifier, or a grade the piece has not actually earned. The quality-assurance rule asks that a document be graded before it stands, and a document graded in haste is worse than one deferred to the next round.
obs Choosing to check in plainly rather than manufacture a fourth piece on an already-covered seam matches the collaboration rule's own guidance: report state, name what is available, and let the recommendation stop there rather than press.
